# REQUIRES: verilator
# Staged evaluation (--stage-levels) of classes with late outputs and held
# virtual-memory reads. Every pass of a staged class (its ready passes too)
# reads its state and inputs its stages before its slot and writes its outputs
# at its slot from the last stage: a late output takes the stages as latency
# (its readers wait for the slot), and a ready pass reads the stages before
# it. A held read's request leaves a host cycle after the state pass from
# registers of the last stage's row, held row and enables (the skip decided
# there, for the state pass's instance). Against the targets, with bubbles and
# stalled channels:
# - Driver/Inputs/late_staged (tb_late.sv): a leaf whose output is late and
#   deep (a combinational RAM read through two multiplies, mixed with its
#   input); top_state.sv: four leaves' outputs written at their state passes;
#   top_ready.sv: the last leaf's output back into the first leaf's state in
#   the same cycle (ready passes), at 2 and 5 stages, and paged, two copies
#   under nested sequencers with zero-latency, shared, staged and compact
#   links; top.sv: a chain, the cut soonest first.
# - Driver/Inputs/vmem_held_deep (tb_vmem.sv): the same with the RAM virtual
#   and read at a held address (--vmem-skip-held-reads): fewer reads than
#   cycles x instances, staged 2 and 4 stages, the cut soonest first (a held
#   row of the read side's stage 0 instead mismatches at cycle 5), and paged
#   copies with ready passes (paged registers the ready passes read keep their
#   stores through the stages); Driver/Inputs/vmem_held: eight leaves, paged.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t && cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/late_staged
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top_state.f --top Top --out %t/st0 --static --bubbles Leaf > /dev/null 2>&1
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/st0/obj %S/Inputs/tb_late.sv leaf.sv top_state.sv %t/st0/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/st0/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/st0/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+2 +bubble=30 +stall=20 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top_state.f --top Top --out %t/st6 --static --bubbles --stage-levels 6 Leaf > /dev/null 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=ST6 < %t/st6/schedule.txt
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/st6/obj %S/Inputs/tb_late.sv leaf.sv top_state.sv %t/st6/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/st6/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/st6/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+2 +bubble=30 +stall=20 | FileCheck %s
