# Registers whose write data is another register's value (Driver/Inputs/
# staged_shift: a shift register with enables, in both orders): the staged
# copy keeps every write's value before replacing any register (one taken
# after its source register was replaced named a freed value: fsd_node_model
# of the FireSim datacenter crashed so, an i1 value as a 13-bit address).
# RUN: cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/staged_shift
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/sh --static --stage-levels 2 Leaf > /dev/null 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=SH < %t/sh/schedule.txt
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -Mdir %t/sh/obj %S/Inputs/tb_late.sv top.sv %t/sh/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/sh/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/sh/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+2 +stall=20 | FileCheck %s
# A staged class's small memories page as rows (--page-memory-bits, pages
# on chip; Driver/Inputs/paged_staged: a RAM read through a register), with
# bubbles and overlapped frames; the reads' half levels count a store of a
# row per instance (a level per doubling past 64 rows, as the logic screen).
# RUN: cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/paged_staged
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/rows --static --page 3 --bubbles --modulo --stage-levels 1 Leaf > /dev/null 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=ROWS < %t/rows/schedule.txt
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/rows/obj %S/Inputs/tb_late.sv top.sv %t/rows/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/rows/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/rows/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+1 +bubble=30 | FileCheck %s
# A --multicycle request is never ignored: on a class it cannot apply to (late
# outputs, held reads) or without --stage-levels it is an error naming why; a
# glob that matches no class is a warning.
# RUN: cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/vmem_held
# RUN: not foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/mc1 --static --virtual-memories ram --vmem-skip-held-reads --multicycle Leaf:3 --stage-levels 1 Leaf > %t/mc1.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=MC1 < %t/mc1.log
# RUN: not foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/mc2 --static --multicycle Leaf:3 Leaf > %t/mc2.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=MC2 < %t/mc2.log
# RUN: cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/vmem_staged
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/mc3 --static --virtual-memories ram --multicycle 'Nope:3,Leaf:3' --stage-levels 1 Leaf > %t/mc3.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=MC3 < %t/mc3.log
